{"version":1,"content":"<p>COLLAR成員蘇雅琳（Ivy）推出新歌《葬花辭》，繼續參與填詞，以苦戀為題，並嘗試帶有古典韻味的小調式音樂。</p><p>為配合歌曲風格，Ivy在MV中以多個典雅造型亮相，展現女性韻味。</p><p>MV亦融入粵劇元素，勾起她童年接觸粵劇的回憶。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T10:03:51.520906+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T09:19:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T15:19:20.876234+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T09:58:04.864471+00:00","content_hash":"61d8b26b66af64c2717baacbd0e5c1f35303ad39e9bf539def4756f2ae7f8989","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}